                  `Rate: ${(args.rate * 100).toFixed(2)}%\n` +
                  `Time: ${args.time} years\n` +
                  `Compounding: ${args.n} times per year\n\n` +
                  `Final Amount: $${amount.toFixed(2)}\n` +
                  `Interest Earned: $${interest.toFixed(2)}\n` +
