```

### `ModelUsage`

Per-model usage statistics returned in result messages.

```typescript
type ModelUsage = {
  inputTokens: number;
  outputTokens: number;
  cacheReadInputTokens: number;
  cacheCreationInputTokens: number;
  webSearchRequests: number;
  costUSD: number;
  contextWindow: number;
}
```

### `ConfigScope`

```typescript
