```

### `NonNullableUsage`

A version of [`Usage`](#usage) with all nullable fields made non-nullable.

```typescript
type NonNullableUsage = {
  [K in keyof Usage]: NonNullable<Usage[K]>;
}
```

### `Usage`

Token usage statistics (from `@anthropic-ai/sdk`).

```typescript
